Recommends: pyra-config-desktop
Description: sound tray icon for the DragonBox Pyra
 A sound icon for MATE's Notification Area that takes the place of
 mate-volume-control-status-icon on the Pyra (the package hides MATE's
 icon). Left click mutes and unmutes the sound; right click opens a small
 window to switch between the speakers and the headphones. The volume
 wheel stays with pyra_volumed; when the running daemon doesn't drive the
 headphones, the window also offers a headphone volume slider.
 .
 It works with the Pyra's AESS kernels (5.6.19-m4*) only and needs no
 root: everything goes through PulseAudio as the logged-in user.
